-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  std_hash_sha512.adam - System.Hash's SHA-512 (FIPS 180-4), the hash
  inside Ed25519 (RFC 8032): the empty input, "abc" and the 112-byte
  two-block message (FIPS 180-4's examples), runs of 'a' around the length
  field's edge (111: it fits, 112: it starts a second block) and the
  128-byte block edge (127, 128, 129), past them (1000); input in pieces of
  1, 7 and 128 bytes giving the one-call digest, a hasher used again after
  Final, Update over memory, the digest size, Kind(), UTF-8 text. Digests
  checked against Python's hashlib. The same lines on both targets.
*******************************************************************************/

/*
